From: Kartheek E <karte@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Sep 2026
Subject: [PATCH] pWHM: beacon WiFi 7 EHT IEs based on MLDUnitSetting behavior

Introduce Radio.IEEE80211be.MLDUnitSetting (Required/NotRequired/Assumed)
to control whether Wi-Fi 7 (EHT/MLD) beacon IEs are advertised when a VAP
has no valid MLDUnit configured:
 - Required: WiFi7 disabled (fallback to WiFi6) if MLDUnit is invalid
 - NotRequired: EHT-only (no MLD IEs) if MLDUnit is invalid
 - Assumed (default): full WiFi7/MLD assumed whenever the radio is
   MLO-capable, even without an explicit MLDUnit

Signed-off-by: Kartheek E <karte@qti.qualcomm.com>
